  "AssumptionNames": [
    "\\A N \\in 0..3 : \\A R \\in SUBSET ((1..N) \\X (1..N)) : /\\ TC1(R) = TC2(R) /\\ TC2(R) = TC3(R) /\\ TC3(R) = TC4(R)",
    "\\A N \\in 0..3 : \\A R \\in SUBSET ((1..N) \\X (1..N)) : LET RR(s, t) == <<s, t>> \\in R S == Support(R) IN \\A s, t \\in S : TC5(RR, S, s, t) <=> (<<s, t>> \\in TC1(R))"
  ],
